1. Load `docs/planning-rosetta-stone.md` into normal context (file reference, not inline paste).
2. Use `HOOK_ID` entries to find related concepts and follow `PRIMARY FILES` / `UNLOCKS`.
3. Load `docs/thread-outline-with-metatags.md` when meta-tag detail is needed.
4. Prefer distilled repo files over re-reading `docs/HIVE_PLANNING_DEV.md` unless a hook points there or content is not yet extracted.
